// The B08 boss arena (WP-076): Cinderdeep's forge, and the Forgeheart Colossus.
// docs/game/05-enemies-and-bosses.md, "B08 Forgeheart Colossus". The scenario keeps the level's
// x and z (the forge is x 44..78, z 54..92, entered from the corridor x 26..44, z 78..86) on a
// flat floor at y = 0, so the boss's `params` (lava edges, in meters from its spawn) fit both.
// The level format (WP-040) has no round or lava rooms yet, so lava is only the boss's
// mechanic: it creeps in from the four walls in phase 2.
//   - The player spawns at (36, 0, 82) facing +X, in the corridor, outside the fog gate.
//   - The fog gate is the plane x = 44, 8 m wide, opening east into the forge.
//   - The Colossus stands at (62, 0, 72) facing -X (toward the gate).
//   - Four pillars, 2 m square and 8 m tall, stand at (52, 62), (72, 62), (52, 84), (72, 84).
//   - The forge has no edge to fall off, and a second way out of every corner: the pillars leave
//     lanes 18 m wide between them.
(
